Readplace now opens Hand Picked at launch. Every article you save is added to it. To add an older save, use “Add to readlist” on the web. The Hand Picked screen links to it. Open All to see every save, including newsletter links and imports. In the reader, a highlight now appears the moment you press Highlight. Deleting an article now says it leaves only that readlist. Marking an article read or unread now explains that the status is shared across readlists.
